WEBVTT

01:49.710 --> 01:54.890
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.009 --> 01:57.940
[Episode 34]

01:59.640 --> 02:00.430
Yiting.

02:00.590 --> 02:01.640
Please, let me explain.

02:01.640 --> 02:04.280
I-I swear I didn't ask Father
to send those geese.

02:04.280 --> 02:07.280
I had no idea he was planning
to arrange this marriage.

02:08.360 --> 02:09.190
I'm telling the truth.

02:09.190 --> 02:09.910
If I'm lying,

02:09.910 --> 02:11.510
may I be struck by lightning!

02:14.190 --> 02:16.070
If it wasn't Your Highness's instruction,

02:16.070 --> 02:17.630
then it must have been His Majesty's will.

02:17.630 --> 02:18.150
He...

02:19.470 --> 02:19.870
Yiting.

02:19.870 --> 02:20.800
Don't worry.

02:20.800 --> 02:21.800
As long as it's something
you don't agree to,

02:21.800 --> 02:23.400
I'll never force it upon you.

02:23.400 --> 02:24.079
How about this?

02:24.079 --> 02:24.810
Tomorrow...

02:24.870 --> 02:25.150
No.

02:25.150 --> 02:26.360
I'll go see Father right away,

02:26.360 --> 02:27.150
clear things up,

02:27.150 --> 02:28.190
and get him to drop this idea,

02:28.190 --> 02:28.960
alright?

02:30.430 --> 02:31.240
Okay.

02:31.560 --> 02:33.560
Then I'll leave it to Your Highness.

02:33.560 --> 02:34.960
It's only proper.

02:36.240 --> 02:39.780
[Grace and Harmony]

02:43.000 --> 02:43.800
Yiting.

02:47.030 --> 02:47.840
If,

02:48.190 --> 02:49.520
I mean hypothetically,

02:49.960 --> 02:50.750
if

02:51.120 --> 02:52.590
Shangguan He weren't in the picture,

02:52.590 --> 02:54.710
or if Shangguan He didn't treat you well,

02:54.710 --> 02:55.520
would you...

03:00.910 --> 03:02.240
Consider me?

03:10.600 --> 03:14.300
[Song Residence]

03:15.150 --> 03:15.960
Father.

03:16.310 --> 03:17.150
I'm back.

03:19.590 --> 03:20.560
Greetings, Father-in-law.

03:20.560 --> 03:22.150
Greetings, Your Highness.

03:23.150 --> 03:24.150
Your Highness,

03:24.710 --> 03:25.520
please.

03:27.870 --> 03:29.400
Father-in-law, after you.

03:30.750 --> 03:31.910
How could I dare?

03:31.910 --> 03:33.590
Please, Your Highness, after you.

03:33.590 --> 03:34.310
No, no, no.

03:34.329 --> 03:35.890
Please, Father-in-law, after you.

03:35.890 --> 03:37.940
I insist Your Highness goes first.

03:38.150 --> 03:38.960
Enough.

03:39.150 --> 03:40.650
The doorway is so wide.

03:40.750 --> 03:42.700
Can't you just walk through together?

03:42.700 --> 03:48.920
[Song Residence]

03:49.040 --> 03:52.810
[Natural Talent]

03:51.590 --> 03:52.400
Father.

03:53.000 --> 03:54.840
Today's the day of my return visit.

03:54.840 --> 03:56.840
Why haven't I seen Yiting and Madam?

03:57.960 --> 03:59.760
The two of them are having a spat.

04:05.690 --> 04:08.330
[Persistence]

04:12.240 --> 04:13.770
Go tell that wretched girl:

04:14.190 --> 04:16.519
if she really wants to drive me
to my grave,

04:16.630 --> 04:19.360
she can keep wasting her time
with that vagabond.

04:19.390 --> 04:20.430
Go tell Mother,

04:20.920 --> 04:22.750
if she keeps forcing me to marry
the Eighteenth Prince,

04:22.750 --> 04:24.120
I'll run off with Shangguan He

04:24.120 --> 04:26.450
and have a child with him
just to spite her.

04:27.800 --> 04:28.800
What did you say?

04:29.190 --> 04:30.600
You little brat.

04:30.600 --> 04:32.430
Have you no sense of shame left at all?

04:32.430 --> 04:33.680
I'm talking to you!

04:33.950 --> 04:35.750
Y-You're really going to be
the death of me!

04:35.750 --> 04:36.920
You've got all the sense of shame
in the world, Mother.

04:36.920 --> 04:39.850
Why don't you marry
the Eighteenth Prince yourself?

04:41.240 --> 04:43.040
You're really driving me crazy!

04:59.950 --> 05:01.000
This is a family gathering.

05:01.000 --> 05:02.000
Please, no need for formalities.

05:02.000 --> 05:02.360
Come on.

05:02.360 --> 05:03.160
Cheers.

05:03.430 --> 05:04.240
That's right.

05:05.160 --> 05:06.890
Only eating greens and no meat?

05:07.270 --> 05:09.800
Careful, you might
have trouble conceiving.

05:10.310 --> 05:12.640
I never intended to have children anyway.

05:12.720 --> 05:13.510
Yiting.

05:14.800 --> 05:16.830
You've lost quite some weight recently.

05:16.830 --> 05:17.630
Here,

05:18.070 --> 05:19.720
let me get you some shrimp.

05:19.830 --> 05:21.270
Why should she eat shrimp?

05:21.270 --> 05:22.830
She's not going to have children anyway.

05:22.830 --> 05:23.690
Have some soup.

05:24.430 --> 05:25.240
Soup?

05:25.360 --> 05:27.390
I think what she should have is
the Five-Flavored Tea of Forgetfulness,

05:27.390 --> 05:28.360
so that in her next life,

05:28.360 --> 05:31.360
she can have an eye for some truly
good and worthy guys.

05:31.600 --> 05:33.270
Those "good guys" you speak of

05:33.390 --> 05:34.920
are nothing but vulgar creatures,

05:34.920 --> 05:36.120
not worth looking at.

05:37.270 --> 05:38.159
Right. Right.

05:38.720 --> 05:40.390
Since you look down on everyone,

05:40.390 --> 05:42.560
I figure the King of Hell
must be exceptional,

05:42.560 --> 05:44.360
surely he meets your standards?

05:45.600 --> 05:47.040
Well, Your Highness,

05:47.800 --> 05:50.720
this braised pork trotter is a specialty
of our Song Residence.

05:50.720 --> 05:51.920
You must give it a try.

05:52.000 --> 05:52.600
Thank you, Mr. So...

05:52.600 --> 05:54.460
The dishes today are quite salty.

05:59.310 --> 06:00.240
Have a quail egg.

06:00.240 --> 06:00.870
Here.

06:08.000 --> 06:09.000
Have some shrimp.

06:09.310 --> 06:09.950
Yes.

06:09.950 --> 06:10.870
The shrimp is delicious too.

06:10.870 --> 06:11.510
Right. Right.

06:11.510 --> 06:12.190
Thank you.

06:19.950 --> 06:20.750
Well,

06:22.040 --> 06:22.800
Mrs. Song,

06:22.800 --> 06:23.480
Mr. Song.

06:24.000 --> 06:24.800
Today

06:24.800 --> 06:26.800
is my first time dining with you,

06:26.800 --> 06:28.800
and from now on, we are all family.

06:28.920 --> 06:30.560
I'd like to toast to you.

06:30.560 --> 06:31.560
Alright. Thanks.

06:36.800 --> 06:37.750
Your manners.

06:39.870 --> 06:41.750
Didn't His Highness just say

06:42.070 --> 06:43.240
this is a family gathering,

06:43.240 --> 06:44.270
and there's no need for formalities?

06:44.270 --> 06:45.950
Why talk about manners?

06:48.040 --> 06:49.480
Don't go too far.

06:50.040 --> 06:51.040
Hey, Song Yude.

06:51.680 --> 06:54.040
Can you stop pretending to be clueless?

06:54.040 --> 06:55.120
Don't you know that

06:55.120 --> 06:56.750
the guy Yiting fell for is

06:56.750 --> 06:59.480
one of Your Highness's subordinates,
I suppose?

07:01.010 --> 07:01.860
Mother.

07:02.390 --> 07:04.830
Today is the homecoming banquet for
Yimeng and His Highness.

07:04.830 --> 07:06.560
Do you have to make everyone
uncomfortable?

07:06.560 --> 07:08.620
Am I making everyone uncomfortable?

07:08.800 --> 07:09.800
Have you forgotten

07:09.800 --> 07:12.360
how badly they hurt you
in that shabby room

07:12.360 --> 07:13.800
at Zijin Pavilion?

07:13.800 --> 07:15.260
Have you forgotten it all?

07:16.360 --> 07:16.920
Mrs. Song.

07:16.920 --> 07:17.630
Well,

07:17.920 --> 07:19.800
about what happened at Zijin Pavilion,

07:19.800 --> 07:21.240
I was indeed in the wrong.

07:22.390 --> 07:23.720
I'd like to take this opportunity

07:23.720 --> 07:24.600
to apologize to the Song family

07:24.600 --> 07:26.480
and to Miss Song Yiting.

07:26.830 --> 07:28.680
If anyone in the Song Residence
has any needs in the future,

07:28.680 --> 07:29.600
please don't hesitate to ask.

07:29.600 --> 07:31.190
I'll certainly make amends.

07:31.190 --> 07:32.040
You're too kind.

07:32.040 --> 07:32.560
It's nothing.

07:32.560 --> 07:33.000
It's only right.

07:33.000 --> 07:34.310
How could we possibly deserve
such a grand gesture?

07:34.310 --> 07:36.390
Your Highness, that subordinate of yours,
Shangguan He,

07:36.390 --> 07:38.560
is still shamelessly hanging around our
Song family now.

07:38.560 --> 07:40.310
If he hadn't been leading our Yiting on,

07:40.310 --> 07:41.190
would her marriage prospects

07:41.190 --> 07:42.750
be in such a state now?

07:42.950 --> 07:44.480
Would we have offended His Majesty

07:44.480 --> 07:46.010
and the Eighteenth Prince?

07:46.630 --> 07:48.750
Mother, please stop making
baseless accusations.

07:48.750 --> 07:51.070
Not marrying the Eighteenth Prince
was my decision.

07:51.070 --> 07:52.560
It has nothing to do with His Highness

07:52.560 --> 07:53.240
and Shangguan He!

07:53.240 --> 07:54.360
Even so,

07:54.720 --> 07:56.390
Your Highness still owes our Song family

07:56.390 --> 07:57.680
an explanation.

07:58.190 --> 07:59.920
If you truly feel sorry,

07:59.920 --> 08:02.070
you should send your subordinate
Shangguan He

08:02.070 --> 08:03.870
back to Jiangnan immediately,

08:03.870 --> 08:06.000
so none of us ever have to see him again.

08:16.480 --> 08:17.570
Your Highness.

08:18.040 --> 08:19.390
Please have another drink.

08:19.390 --> 08:20.070
You...

08:20.070 --> 08:20.800
Have a sip.

08:29.830 --> 08:30.760
Are you alright?

08:33.440 --> 08:35.270
I'll handle the matter
with Shangguan He myself,

08:35.270 --> 08:37.669
Mother, so stop making things difficult
for others.

08:37.669 --> 08:38.480
I'm finished eating.

08:38.480 --> 08:39.809
Please enjoy your meal.

08:42.270 --> 08:43.000
Let's go.

08:45.200 --> 08:46.030
Mr. Song,

08:46.440 --> 08:47.200
Mrs. Song.

08:47.790 --> 08:49.030
I still have official matters
to attend to.

08:49.030 --> 08:50.360
Please enjoy your meal.

08:50.440 --> 08:51.200
Oh, okay.

08:51.320 --> 08:52.240
Father, Madam.

08:52.320 --> 08:53.580
Please take your time.

09:03.630 --> 09:04.440
Eat up.

09:04.510 --> 09:06.170
Why don't you go ahead and eat?

09:14.730 --> 09:17.070
[Dream-version Chinese Checkers]

09:16.200 --> 09:17.130
Hidden weapons?

09:22.750 --> 09:24.390
Do you think Shangguan He

09:23.020 --> 09:26.400
[Dream-version Scraping Plate]

09:24.390 --> 09:26.080
actually has feelings for Yiting?

09:26.080 --> 09:26.880
A waist token?

09:27.320 --> 09:28.960
If he truly has no feelings for her,

09:28.960 --> 09:30.820
he should just tell her directly,

09:31.030 --> 09:32.470
so she can move on.

09:33.360 --> 09:34.360
He's completed the mission I assigned him

09:34.360 --> 09:35.670
a long time ago,

09:35.910 --> 09:37.570
yet he still hasn't returned.

09:37.700 --> 09:38.510
Tell me,

09:38.720 --> 09:40.790
how could he not have feelings for her?

09:40.790 --> 09:41.630
Look,

09:41.960 --> 09:43.360
he clearly has feelings for her,

09:43.360 --> 09:44.600
yet he won't take the initiative,
won't turn her down,

09:44.600 --> 09:45.910
and won't own up to anything.

09:45.910 --> 09:48.040
Isn't he just stringing Yiting along,

09:48.080 --> 09:50.550
wasting her precious youth?

09:51.200 --> 09:53.330
What do you mean, stringing her along?

09:53.840 --> 09:54.750
Let me tell you,

09:55.320 --> 09:56.920
men and women are different.

09:57.360 --> 09:58.390
And Shangguan He

09:58.630 --> 10:00.760
is even more different from other men.

10:00.910 --> 10:02.630
He does have feelings for Song Yiting,

10:02.630 --> 10:03.440
but,

10:03.960 --> 10:05.200
he's also afraid.

10:07.910 --> 10:08.840
What do you mean?

10:09.240 --> 10:10.320
Explain it to me,

10:10.550 --> 10:11.680
what is he afraid of?

10:13.360 --> 10:14.360
Your sister,

10:14.480 --> 10:15.670
whether it's her appearance,

10:15.670 --> 10:17.000
talent, character,

10:17.000 --> 10:17.960
or cultivation,

10:18.000 --> 10:19.460
she excels in everything.

10:19.720 --> 10:22.440
Moreover, Prince Nan Rui
is now pursuing her.

10:22.720 --> 10:24.320
But what about Shangguan He?

10:24.510 --> 10:26.320
He's just a nobody from
the martial arts world.

10:26.320 --> 10:28.520
What can he possibly offer your sister?

10:30.790 --> 10:32.960
Again with this talk of
matching social status.

10:32.960 --> 10:34.440
Such an outdated excuse.

10:34.720 --> 10:36.050
When it comes down to it,

10:36.120 --> 10:37.440
it's just your men's ego

10:37.440 --> 10:38.900
causing all this trouble.

10:42.320 --> 10:43.580
What you said is right,

10:44.510 --> 10:45.970
but not completely right.

10:46.720 --> 10:47.630
It's true that Shangguan He

10:47.630 --> 10:50.390
doesn't want to marry into a family
and live at their mercy.

10:50.390 --> 10:51.650
But more importantly,

10:51.670 --> 10:54.120
it's because he wants
to protect your sister.

10:54.120 --> 10:55.030
He believes

10:55.200 --> 10:57.670
if he can't give his beloved
the future she wants

10:57.670 --> 10:59.070
and the life she desires,

10:59.200 --> 11:01.330
then it's better not to start it at all.

11:02.200 --> 11:05.150
Then why weren't you afraid that
you couldn't give me a future,

11:05.150 --> 11:07.390
yet still insisted on
starting things with me?

11:07.390 --> 11:08.920
I'm the male lead after all.

11:09.480 --> 11:11.000
What can't I give you?

11:14.000 --> 11:15.000
Men.

11:18.320 --> 11:19.440
A head massager?

11:28.840 --> 11:31.870
[Xiyue Pavilion]

11:30.720 --> 11:31.720
Miss Song Yiting.

11:33.030 --> 11:34.490
What can I do for you today?

11:36.080 --> 11:38.270
I only brought you back to
the Song Residence

11:38.270 --> 11:40.080
to complete the mission

11:40.150 --> 11:41.610
assigned by His Highness.

11:42.360 --> 11:44.360
Now that Yimeng's already married,

11:45.080 --> 11:46.750
your mission is accomplished.

11:46.750 --> 11:48.200
The deal between us

11:49.150 --> 11:50.630
should be settled now.

11:51.080 --> 11:56.410
[Xiyue Pavilion]

11:51.480 --> 11:53.880
Here's the monthly payment I promised you.

11:54.360 --> 11:55.360
Take it and leave.

12:01.080 --> 12:02.140
That's quite a lot.

12:04.670 --> 12:06.800
I don't really have much use for money.

12:08.480 --> 12:09.270
Don't you like

12:09.270 --> 12:10.790
the zithers made by that master
at Liuyin Pavilion?

12:10.790 --> 12:13.190
How about I use this money
to buy one for you?

12:24.000 --> 12:24.790
Honestly,

12:25.750 --> 12:27.360
I've been quite free lately.

12:28.120 --> 12:30.000
Chief is newly married
and has no time for me.

12:30.000 --> 12:31.390
And since Yunlong and Shanhu
have returned,

12:31.390 --> 12:33.240
they can take care of
the Waning River Crescent.

12:33.240 --> 12:34.080
Shangguan He!

12:35.150 --> 12:37.080
What on earth are you trying to say?

12:37.360 --> 12:39.320
Even though my mother pressures me daily,

12:39.320 --> 12:40.510
to me, marriage

12:40.630 --> 12:42.830
is nothing but an unnecessary shackle.

12:43.000 --> 12:43.840
However,

12:44.030 --> 12:45.910
seeing me trapped under societal pressure,

12:45.910 --> 12:47.270
you have neither the courage to marry me

12:47.270 --> 12:48.870
nor the guts to elope with me.

12:48.870 --> 12:51.530
You just keep
dragging things out ambiguously.

12:51.550 --> 12:53.080
What exactly is your deal?

12:58.720 --> 12:59.510
I...

13:00.240 --> 13:00.750
I...

13:00.750 --> 13:02.280
If you have no other answer,

13:03.000 --> 13:03.910
please leave.

13:12.290 --> 13:15.650
[Natural Talent]

13:25.720 --> 13:27.000
Where are His Highness and Her Highness?

13:27.000 --> 13:27.930
Inside the room.

13:28.180 --> 13:29.080
What's wrong?

13:29.080 --> 13:31.280
Lord Qianyu has come back from the dead!

13:32.630 --> 13:33.440
What?

13:38.510 --> 13:41.990
[Yan Gate]

13:43.910 --> 13:45.330
Isn't this Lord Qianyu?

13:45.370 --> 13:46.550
Good heavens!

13:46.550 --> 13:48.270
Didn't Lord Qianyu die in battle
not long ago?

13:48.270 --> 13:49.200
How is he alive again?

13:49.200 --> 13:50.910
Don't you see Junior General and
the Qianyu Army?

13:50.910 --> 13:51.970
This can't be fake.

13:52.080 --> 13:53.510
Why is Chu Guihong back?

13:53.510 --> 13:55.270
Isn't the court hunting him down?

13:55.270 --> 13:56.080
Haven't you heard?

13:56.080 --> 13:58.270
His Highness has personally pardoned him.

13:58.270 --> 13:59.240
I see.

14:01.000 --> 14:01.790
Father.

14:02.320 --> 14:03.360
The assassination attempt on Nan Heng

14:03.360 --> 14:04.790
has caused a great stir in the city.

14:04.790 --> 14:06.670
I'm sure Nan Heng won't
let this go easily.

14:06.670 --> 14:07.480
Why should you be worried?

14:07.480 --> 14:08.630
I'm here, aren't I?

14:08.630 --> 14:09.240
I

14:09.240 --> 14:11.240
will definitely protect your life.

14:12.910 --> 14:13.720
Uncle!

14:14.320 --> 14:15.120
Uncle!

14:17.760 --> 14:19.000
It's me, Uncle!

14:19.030 --> 14:19.880
Nan Rui?

14:24.790 --> 14:25.930
You've grown so much,

14:25.930 --> 14:27.000
even taller than me.

14:27.000 --> 14:27.950
Uncle.

14:28.200 --> 14:29.000
When I received the letter,

14:29.000 --> 14:30.550
I couldn't believe you were still alive!

14:30.550 --> 14:31.960
This is wonderful!

14:35.360 --> 14:36.150
Guihong.

14:36.150 --> 14:36.840
You...

14:38.790 --> 14:39.870
By His Majesty's decree:

14:39.870 --> 14:41.120
a banquet has been specially arranged

14:41.120 --> 14:42.320
for Lord Qianyu's return to the capital.

14:42.320 --> 14:46.320
Your Lordship is invited into the palace
for a meeting with His Majesty.

14:53.450 --> 14:54.790
Come on. Make way.

14:58.080 --> 14:59.210
That's impossible.

14:59.600 --> 15:01.930
In the script, Lord Qianyu died in battle.

15:02.630 --> 15:04.440
There's never been any twist about this,

15:04.440 --> 15:06.750
not even before I die.

15:08.630 --> 15:09.440
Nan Heng.

15:10.000 --> 15:11.150
Could it be because

15:11.150 --> 15:12.840
we broke the script rule

15:12.910 --> 15:13.860
that the plot

15:14.080 --> 15:15.200
has been changed?

15:17.240 --> 15:18.030
It's okay.

15:18.480 --> 15:19.940
In the current situation,

15:20.240 --> 15:21.440
we'll roll with the punches

15:21.440 --> 15:23.640
and deal with everything as it happens.

15:24.000 --> 15:24.980
You don't understand.

15:24.980 --> 15:26.600
If we've truly changed the plot,

15:26.600 --> 15:28.750
it means all the information I had

15:28.750 --> 15:30.150
has become meaningless.

15:30.720 --> 15:32.150
Without the cheat code,

15:32.430 --> 15:33.890
how can we change our fate?

15:36.910 --> 15:37.750
Don't worry.

15:38.200 --> 15:39.200
Don't forget,

15:39.200 --> 15:41.550
the part where we were supposed
to stab each other on our wedding day

15:41.550 --> 15:43.510
was successfully prevented, wasn't it?

15:43.510 --> 15:44.320
So you see,

15:44.630 --> 15:47.090
what changes our fate isn't
some cheat code,

15:47.120 --> 15:48.030
but you and I.

15:51.480 --> 15:52.270
But...

15:52.270 --> 15:53.070
In the future,

15:53.600 --> 15:55.240
no matter what happens,

15:55.550 --> 15:57.280
I'll face it together with you.

16:11.390 --> 16:15.070
[The Late Empress's Residence,
Fengyi Palace]

16:12.000 --> 16:14.960
I never thought that after years of
searching for the truth,

16:14.960 --> 16:17.280
the culprit was right before our eyes.

16:17.720 --> 16:18.840
Gao Changyin

16:19.000 --> 16:21.200
has been hiding his true nature so well.

16:22.600 --> 16:24.000
By the way, Your Majesty,

16:24.200 --> 16:27.000
why did you appoint the Seventh Prince
as crown prince?

16:27.000 --> 16:27.930
Uncle.

16:28.360 --> 16:30.910
Heng is actually quite a decent person.

16:31.080 --> 16:32.870
In the end, it was thanks to
his placing justice above family ties

16:32.870 --> 16:33.960
and exposing Gao Changyin

16:33.960 --> 16:36.220
that the Qianyu Army's name was cleared.

16:36.270 --> 16:37.080
Besides,

16:37.360 --> 16:38.480
I have neither the desire

16:38.480 --> 16:40.410
nor the ability to be crown prince.

16:40.510 --> 16:41.480
It was perfectly reasonable for Father

16:41.480 --> 16:42.880
to name him crown prince.

16:43.000 --> 16:43.840
Uncle.

16:44.870 --> 16:47.270
The court has finally found peace.

16:48.270 --> 16:49.870
And regarding Guihong's attempt
to assassinate Heng,

16:49.870 --> 16:51.630
Heng has agreed
not to pursue this matter further.

16:51.630 --> 16:52.360
Let's just

16:53.240 --> 16:55.120
call it even, shall we?

17:05.440 --> 17:07.180
After my brush with death,

17:07.349 --> 17:09.829
I've come to terms with many things.

17:12.920 --> 17:13.720
Guihong.

17:14.589 --> 17:16.270
Today, before your Aunt's memorial,

17:16.270 --> 17:17.720
don't you think you should

17:17.720 --> 17:19.720
formally apologize to His Majesty?

17:26.880 --> 17:28.440
Your Majesty, please forgive me.

17:28.440 --> 17:29.810
I should have remained at my border post,

17:29.810 --> 17:31.030
yet I abandoned my duty

17:31.030 --> 17:32.850
and rashly attempted
to assassinate His Highness.

17:32.850 --> 17:34.310
My crime is unforgivable.

17:35.270 --> 17:36.440
I beg Your Majesty

17:36.830 --> 17:37.680
to consider the Chu family's

17:37.680 --> 17:40.270
years of loyal service guarding
the Great Jing's borders

17:40.270 --> 17:41.680
and grant me another chance.

17:41.680 --> 17:43.030
I will certainly redeem myself

17:43.030 --> 17:45.440
and serve the Great Jing
through fire and water

17:45.440 --> 17:46.640
without hesitation.

17:52.960 --> 17:53.920
Chu Guihong.

17:54.790 --> 17:57.190
You were once Yurong's most beloved child.

17:57.880 --> 17:59.230
When it comes down to it,

17:59.350 --> 18:01.070
the conflict between you and Heng

18:01.070 --> 18:03.720
all stems from old grudges.

18:05.750 --> 18:08.400
Now that Lord Qianyu has returned
to the capital,

18:08.400 --> 18:10.550
I have no wish to keep you two apart.

18:11.480 --> 18:13.080
You may remain in the capital

18:13.110 --> 18:15.270
for the time being.

18:17.680 --> 18:18.480
Thank you, Your Majesty.

18:18.480 --> 18:19.110
However,

18:21.400 --> 18:24.330
if you dare show disrespect to
my Crown Prince again,

18:25.070 --> 18:26.170
you won't be so lucky

18:26.170 --> 18:28.870
next time.

18:43.310 --> 18:44.510
I wasn't wrong, was I?

18:44.960 --> 18:46.720
His Majesty is totally lovestruck,

18:46.720 --> 18:47.510
and Nan Rui

18:47.510 --> 18:48.720
is just brainless.

18:48.880 --> 18:50.270
As long as you show your loyalty,

18:50.270 --> 18:51.310
all past transgressions

18:51.310 --> 18:52.790
can surely be wiped clean.

18:55.070 --> 18:56.530
Others are easy to manage,

18:56.790 --> 18:57.880
but as for Nan Heng,

18:59.570 --> 19:01.690
given how far things have deteriorated
between us,

19:01.690 --> 19:03.170
truly clearing the grudges

19:03.170 --> 19:04.370
and earning his trust

19:04.640 --> 19:06.240
won't be so easy, I'm afraid.

19:06.720 --> 19:07.640
Son,

19:09.720 --> 19:10.790
why should you worry?

19:10.790 --> 19:12.160
I'm here, aren't I?

19:12.440 --> 19:13.940
At tonight's banquet,

19:14.030 --> 19:14.830
I'll make sure

19:15.550 --> 19:18.010
to help you smooth things over
with Nan Heng.

19:29.920 --> 19:30.720
Uncle.

19:31.270 --> 19:33.110
You've had a hard time out there lately.

19:33.110 --> 19:35.110
Have more meat to nourish yourself.

19:46.000 --> 19:46.860
Your Highness.

19:47.590 --> 19:48.920
I must apologize to you.

19:49.070 --> 19:50.310
On Your Highness's joyous day,

19:50.310 --> 19:51.640
I caused a disturbance.

19:52.110 --> 19:53.510
Though Your Highness,
magnanimous as ever,

19:53.510 --> 19:54.880
did not hold me accountable,

19:54.880 --> 19:56.880
I still feel deeply ashamed.

19:58.160 --> 19:59.550
I'll punish myself with this drink.

19:59.550 --> 20:01.510
Thank you for your magnanimity,
Your Highness,

20:01.510 --> 20:03.710
and for not holding the past against me.

20:10.680 --> 20:12.200
You see, I told you before,

20:12.230 --> 20:13.440
Heng is magnanimous

20:13.440 --> 20:15.770
and not someone who holds grudges, right?

20:18.770 --> 20:19.610
Lord Qianyu.

20:21.310 --> 20:22.410
There's something

20:22.640 --> 20:24.440
I've been puzzling over.

20:28.350 --> 20:30.150
Please go ahead, Your Highness.

20:31.350 --> 20:33.100
When Pingrong City fell,

20:33.160 --> 20:35.090
not even a small bird could fly out.

20:35.200 --> 20:37.270
How did you manage to escape?

20:41.510 --> 20:43.460
I remember when the city fell,

20:43.680 --> 20:46.960
I intended to protect our banner
and fight to the last moment.

20:46.960 --> 20:49.220
However, several Deputy Generals
knocked me unconscious,

20:49.220 --> 20:51.530
put on my armor to impersonate me,

20:51.680 --> 20:53.680
and dressed me in Heyuan Army's armor,

20:53.680 --> 20:55.530
hiding me among their dead.

20:55.640 --> 20:56.440
I

20:56.720 --> 20:58.450
only survived because of this.

20:59.310 --> 21:00.870
After escaping from Pingrong,

21:00.870 --> 21:02.830
why did you not come to rendezvous with me

21:02.830 --> 21:05.590
and choose to run for your life instead?

21:07.030 --> 21:09.510
I had deep misunderstanding
about Your Highness before,

21:09.510 --> 21:10.620
even suspecting

21:10.680 --> 21:13.280
you were behind the defeat
of Pingrong battle.

21:13.440 --> 21:16.200
So of course, I was reluctant to seek out
the Xuanjia Army.

21:16.200 --> 21:18.440
Then after the Xuanjia Army
returned to the capital,

21:18.440 --> 21:20.640
why didn't you come back
to report to His Majesty?

21:20.640 --> 21:21.920
Did you not trust

21:22.750 --> 21:23.880
His Majesty either?

21:25.790 --> 21:27.000
During those days,

21:27.590 --> 21:30.000
I wandered through the countryside,

21:30.680 --> 21:33.740
and whenever I thought of
the 20,000 soldiers who died,

21:33.750 --> 21:36.110
I wanted to take my own life to atone.

21:36.550 --> 21:38.590
But I still have my son, Guihong,

21:38.920 --> 21:40.030
who lost his mother at a young age

21:40.030 --> 21:41.510
and has no siblings.

21:41.590 --> 21:43.790
How could I leave him with peace of mind?

21:44.070 --> 21:44.880
For his sake,

21:45.550 --> 21:48.000
I forced myself to carry on,

21:48.160 --> 21:49.440
fleeing to the outskirts of the capital

21:49.440 --> 21:52.100
to find an opportunity
to reunite with Guihong.

21:55.480 --> 21:56.920
As parents,

21:57.030 --> 21:58.440
this is all we care about.

21:58.720 --> 21:59.520
Chu Li.

22:00.030 --> 22:00.510
Here.

22:01.030 --> 22:02.030
I understand you.

22:04.110 --> 22:05.510
Thank you, Your Majesty.

22:13.160 --> 22:14.020
Your Highness.

22:14.440 --> 22:15.310
I know

22:15.590 --> 22:18.030
the Chu family and Your Highness
have been entangled for years,

22:18.030 --> 22:19.640
with deep misunderstandings between us.

22:19.640 --> 22:21.070
I have no intention of

22:21.070 --> 22:23.200
threatening Your Highness upon my return.

22:23.200 --> 22:25.240
I hope Your Highness can
put aside past grievances.

22:25.240 --> 22:25.920
From now on,

22:26.200 --> 22:28.440
I will serve with utmost loyalty

22:28.550 --> 22:30.830
and work together with Your Highness

22:30.920 --> 22:32.200
to defend our state.

22:35.000 --> 22:36.260
Lord Qianyu, you jest.

22:36.550 --> 22:38.790
Junior General and I
share the same banner.

22:38.790 --> 22:40.590
We'll certainly put aside past grievances

22:40.590 --> 22:42.790
and safeguard the Great Jing together.

23:04.110 --> 23:05.320
Dear ministers.

23:05.440 --> 23:07.640
This is the dish we've been waiting for.

23:08.000 --> 23:09.140
This dish

23:09.170 --> 23:11.510
is the famed Daze venison,

23:11.510 --> 23:12.720
known far and wide and
not easily obtained.

23:12.720 --> 23:15.180
Please, everyone, enjoy the dish promptly.

23:25.240 --> 23:27.520
Tender, juicy, with a lingering taste.

23:27.640 --> 23:30.500
This Daze venison truly lives up
to its reputation.

23:46.980 --> 23:52.530
[Fanghua Hall]

23:50.160 --> 23:51.350
It's already so late.

23:51.350 --> 23:53.210
Why hasn't Nan Heng come back yet?

23:53.400 --> 23:55.200
Could something have happened?

23:59.920 --> 24:00.590
Don't scream!

24:00.590 --> 24:01.270
Don't be afraid.

24:01.270 --> 24:02.450
It's me.

24:03.110 --> 24:04.110
Song Xiaoyu!

24:05.830 --> 24:06.860
It's me.

24:12.830 --> 24:14.040
You are...

24:14.590 --> 24:15.720
I just called you Song Xiaoyu.

24:15.720 --> 24:16.780
Who else could I be?

24:20.310 --> 24:22.000
What Song Xiaoyu?

24:22.000 --> 24:23.530
Someone who delivers fish?

24:23.680 --> 24:24.070
I'm sorry,

24:24.070 --> 24:25.030
but you've got the wrong person.

24:25.030 --> 24:26.160
I'm not Song Xiaoyu.

24:26.590 --> 24:27.850
Imperial Jade Liquor?

24:32.350 --> 24:32.920
1...

24:37.510 --> 24:41.000
180 yuan per glass?

24:41.510 --> 24:44.310
Which school is the best
at excavator technology?

24:45.270 --> 24:47.530
Shandong Lan Xiang Technician College.

24:48.070 --> 24:51.790
Meng, Heng, Rui, Ting, and He.

24:54.110 --> 24:57.920
Yin, Rong, Xu, De, and Yi.

24:59.790 --> 25:00.750
We're truly like fellow villagers
meeting fellow villagers,

25:00.750 --> 25:02.070
both with tears in our eyes.

25:02.070 --> 25:04.680
You... You also time-traveled here
from the modern age?

25:04.680 --> 25:06.240
And you've read the script?

25:07.790 --> 25:08.590
But,

25:08.830 --> 25:09.790
who are you?

25:17.070 --> 25:17.700
This...

25:18.270 --> 25:19.170
What's this?

25:27.720 --> 25:29.090
Mr. Screenwriter.

25:30.400 --> 25:31.910
You're Mr. Screenwriter?

25:32.730 --> 25:34.960
I didn't get to talk to you properly
during the script reading that day.

25:34.960 --> 25:35.680
Today,

25:35.680 --> 25:37.400
let me properly introduce myself.

25:37.400 --> 25:38.560
My name is Li Bixiong,

25:38.560 --> 25:39.650
pen name Bixiong.

25:39.680 --> 25:41.010
You can call me Bixiong.

25:42.160 --> 25:44.270
Wait, you actually have the nerve
to come find me?

25:44.270 --> 25:45.450
It's all because of you,

25:45.450 --> 25:46.720
always making that keyboard sound,

25:46.720 --> 25:48.830
that Nan Heng and I faced danger
so many times.

25:48.830 --> 25:50.690
Do you have something against me?

25:50.960 --> 25:52.350
You're one to talk.

25:52.350 --> 25:53.510
You guys keep inexplicably

25:53.510 --> 25:54.590
changing the script back and forth.

25:54.590 --> 25:56.270
I can't even submit my drafts anymore.

25:56.270 --> 25:58.550
The producer and director have been
bombarding me with complaints.

25:58.550 --> 26:00.050
Who can I vent to?

26:04.940 --> 26:07.140
We're both just working stiffs, right?

26:08.110 --> 26:10.770
Let's be understanding
of each other, alright?

26:11.710 --> 26:13.310
I understand, I understand.

26:17.830 --> 26:18.640
But,

26:18.720 --> 26:19.960
how did you

26:20.440 --> 26:21.720
time-travel here?

26:21.750 --> 26:23.790
Did you also get transported here

26:23.790 --> 26:25.050
on a stormy, rainy day?

26:26.590 --> 26:27.400
Also,

26:28.280 --> 26:30.040
how did you know I would be

26:30.110 --> 26:31.570
at Fanghua Hall right now?

26:32.110 --> 26:33.310
That's a long story.

26:34.410 --> 26:36.070
Rather than making a long story short,
it's better not to say anything at all.

26:36.070 --> 26:37.020
I've come today

26:37.050 --> 26:38.370
to ask for a favor.

26:39.270 --> 26:40.070
What is it?

26:41.680 --> 26:44.030
My current identity is Lord Qianyu, right?

26:44.030 --> 26:45.440
But after just a few days together,

26:45.440 --> 26:47.680
Chu Guihong has already
begun to suspect me.

26:47.680 --> 26:49.640
I need to dispel his doubts
as soon as possible.

26:49.640 --> 26:51.270
If he were to find out my identity,

26:51.270 --> 26:52.880
this world would collapse!

26:54.920 --> 26:56.410
Collapse?

27:00.440 --> 27:02.940
So how do you want me to help you?

27:03.500 --> 27:05.100
Let me stay at your residence

27:05.270 --> 27:06.730
and stay away from Chu Guihong.

27:06.730 --> 27:08.390
Less action, fewer mistakes.

27:08.920 --> 27:10.390
Stay at my place?

27:12.920 --> 27:14.150
I'm afraid

27:14.510 --> 27:15.790
that's not appropriate.

27:15.790 --> 27:17.790
I'm a married woman now,

27:17.810 --> 27:19.550
and besides, that's
the Crown Prince's Residence.

27:19.550 --> 27:20.550
If you go live there,

27:20.550 --> 27:22.400
it could cause even bigger problems.

27:22.400 --> 27:23.750
I almost forgot

27:23.750 --> 27:25.610
you've already married Nan Heng.

27:25.860 --> 27:27.080
My Lord.

27:30.030 --> 27:31.420
You said you needed to use the privy,

27:31.420 --> 27:33.790
but how did you end up
in the imperial harem?

27:33.790 --> 27:34.720
Eunuch Liu.

27:34.830 --> 27:36.480
Lord Qianyu has had too much to drink,

27:36.480 --> 27:37.660
so I helped steady him.

27:37.660 --> 27:38.940
Yeah, I'm drunk.

27:38.970 --> 27:40.830
My Lord, come back with me quickly.

27:40.830 --> 27:43.700
His Majesty is still waiting
to have a good drink and talk with you.

27:43.700 --> 27:44.830
Coming.

27:44.850 --> 27:45.710
Consider my proposal.

27:45.710 --> 27:47.830
I'll come find you at
the Crown Prince's Residence later.

27:47.830 --> 27:48.480
Go already.

27:48.480 --> 27:49.510
I'm drunk.

27:50.400 --> 27:52.130
Actually, I'm not drunk at all.

27:53.160 --> 27:53.830
Be careful.

27:53.830 --> 27:54.530
I'm fine.

27:54.550 --> 27:57.040
I can keep... Keep...

27:57.070 --> 27:59.140
Keep drinking.

28:02.580 --> 28:05.800
[Qianyu Mansion]

28:06.450 --> 28:08.110
The imperial palace is truly
something else.

28:08.110 --> 28:09.690
This wine is excellent,

28:09.710 --> 28:10.970
and the meat is deli...

28:11.200 --> 28:12.200
You rascal.

28:13.720 --> 28:14.510
Tell me,

28:15.510 --> 28:16.880
who are you really?

28:18.720 --> 28:19.800
Chu Guihong.

28:20.110 --> 28:21.830
How dare you show such disrespect!

28:21.830 --> 28:23.960
What have I taught you all these years?

28:25.720 --> 28:27.520
The Heyuan people love venison,

28:27.550 --> 28:29.070
and they often slaughter deer
in their camps

28:29.070 --> 28:30.150
in brutal ways.

28:30.680 --> 28:32.480
Father despised this practice,

28:32.750 --> 28:34.070
so he ordered all Qianyu soldiers

28:34.070 --> 28:35.400
not to eat venison,

28:35.680 --> 28:38.340
with military punishment for
any who disobeyed.

28:38.340 --> 28:39.790
Yet today at the banquet, you

28:39.790 --> 28:41.350
ate venison without any hesitation,

28:41.350 --> 28:43.640
completely disregarding
the Qianyu Army's rules.

28:43.640 --> 28:45.070
You cannot be my father.

28:45.820 --> 28:46.610
Tell me,

28:47.830 --> 28:49.290
who exactly are you?

28:58.830 --> 28:59.550
Come on,

28:59.550 --> 29:00.410
attack me here!

29:00.960 --> 29:02.440
What did I tell you when I taught you

29:02.440 --> 29:03.770
how to handle the blade?

29:12.160 --> 29:13.690
Listen up, you little brat.

29:14.920 --> 29:17.120
This blade is for killing enemies.

29:17.150 --> 29:19.020
It must never be pointed at family

29:19.160 --> 29:19.960
or friends.

29:20.400 --> 29:21.460
Do you understand?

29:27.510 --> 29:29.440
What's wrong with eating venison?

29:30.510 --> 29:31.680
If I had been so rigid

29:31.680 --> 29:32.640
and picky about everything,

29:32.640 --> 29:34.160
would I even be alive to see you now?

29:34.160 --> 29:36.420
I think you're just asking for a beating,

29:36.830 --> 29:38.680
daring to pull a weapon on me.

29:38.680 --> 29:39.310
Go!

29:39.310 --> 29:40.240
Go to the ancestral hall

29:40.240 --> 29:41.310
and receive 30 strokes of punishment.

29:41.310 --> 29:43.970
Come see me when
you've thought things through.

29:44.480 --> 29:45.310
Father, I...

29:56.000 --> 29:58.060
Why is each one smarter than the last?

29:58.160 --> 29:59.820
This is getting complicated.

30:00.920 --> 30:02.240
Song Xiaoyu.

30:02.270 --> 30:04.530
You're really going to be the death of me.

30:06.910 --> 30:10.490
[Jize Palace]

30:14.000 --> 30:15.000
Where are my eyes?

30:16.230 --> 30:17.760
She didn't make them for me?

30:19.960 --> 30:21.560
Did you get what I said or not?

30:26.400 --> 30:27.260
You said

30:27.640 --> 30:30.270
the screenwriter is the person
who writes the storybook,

30:30.270 --> 30:32.510
and he's the one inside
Lord Qianyu's body.

30:32.510 --> 30:33.770
So you did get it.

30:34.680 --> 30:37.300
Then why aren't you showing any reaction?

30:37.750 --> 30:40.000
He knows the entire plot.

30:40.000 --> 30:41.460
He's basically cheating.

30:42.640 --> 30:43.640
If you ask me,

30:43.640 --> 30:45.960
you should quickly prepare
some valuable gifts

30:45.960 --> 30:47.440
and pay a visit to the Qianyu Mansion.

30:47.440 --> 30:48.350
You should know,

30:48.350 --> 30:50.310
actors who offend the screenwriter

30:50.310 --> 30:51.640
never end up well.

30:54.030 --> 30:55.420
Let me ask you,

30:55.790 --> 30:57.790
do you know why he came here?

31:04.920 --> 31:07.320
Have you noticed anything unusual lately?

31:12.550 --> 31:13.680
And have you heard

31:13.680 --> 31:14.920
that so-called

31:15.200 --> 31:16.460
keyboard sound again?

31:21.440 --> 31:22.240
No.

31:23.440 --> 31:24.830
Well, if nothing's unusual,

31:24.830 --> 31:26.240
and the rules of this world

31:26.240 --> 31:27.750
have already been broken by us,

31:27.750 --> 31:29.550
then there's no need to fear him.

31:29.830 --> 31:32.150
Even if he created everything
from outside,

31:32.150 --> 31:33.120
in here,

31:33.310 --> 31:35.070
the plot has already changed.

31:35.240 --> 31:36.310
Therefore, the one who should be worried

31:36.310 --> 31:37.590
and can't sit still right now

31:37.590 --> 31:38.590
is him, not us.

31:44.030 --> 31:45.510
So according to you,

31:45.510 --> 31:46.510
Mr. Screenwriter

31:46.680 --> 31:48.810
should even come curry favor with you?

31:49.160 --> 31:50.760
That might actually happen.

31:52.350 --> 31:53.160
Oh, you.

31:53.720 --> 31:54.550
Remember,

31:54.550 --> 31:56.160
you're just a fictional character,

31:56.160 --> 31:57.480
not a producer.

31:57.960 --> 31:59.760
So stop being so arrogant, okay?

32:03.640 --> 32:04.500
Your Highness,

32:04.830 --> 32:05.960
Lord Qianyu is here.

32:07.070 --> 32:08.130
What did I tell you?

32:09.270 --> 32:10.790
Let's go meet this

32:11.640 --> 32:12.440
Mr.

32:12.960 --> 32:13.820
Screenwriter.

32:14.630 --> 32:24.480
[Jize Palace]

32:19.590 --> 32:21.440
You've even come out
to greet me personally.

32:21.440 --> 32:22.240
Come on,

32:22.240 --> 32:22.920
bring the gifts inside.

32:22.920 --> 32:24.920
So you really guessed it right?

32:25.030 --> 32:26.960
He really is here to win your favor?

32:33.750 --> 32:34.680
Your Highness.

32:35.260 --> 32:36.550
I'm new here

32:36.550 --> 32:37.510
and don't understand many of the rules.

32:37.510 --> 32:38.640
You have to help me.

32:39.240 --> 32:40.240
So the gifts...

32:40.240 --> 32:41.170
They're for you.

32:41.790 --> 32:42.640
And if these aren't enough,

32:42.640 --> 32:44.840
there's plenty more at Qianyu Mansion.

32:57.880 --> 32:58.960
What are you looking at?

32:58.960 --> 33:00.360
Got nothing better to do?

33:00.720 --> 33:01.480
With so many strangers going in,

33:01.480 --> 33:03.010
don't you know to stop them?

33:04.960 --> 33:07.970
[Cultivate Virtue and Pursue Knowledge]

33:09.160 --> 33:10.240
Hey, Xiaoyu.

33:10.960 --> 33:13.300
He looks exactly like Nan Feng.

33:13.550 --> 33:15.640
Even that stuck-up celebrity attitude

33:15.640 --> 33:17.960
seems like they were cut
from the same cloth.

33:17.960 --> 33:19.240
You and Lord Qianyu

33:19.270 --> 33:21.000
are quite different, however.

33:21.070 --> 33:22.830
Lord Qianyu didn't eat venison,

33:22.830 --> 33:24.630
and his behavior was dignified,

33:24.640 --> 33:27.160
unlike you, who are so frivolous and rude.

33:28.960 --> 33:30.160
He knows everything?

33:31.590 --> 33:32.150
You...

33:33.160 --> 33:35.050
We're husband and wife.

33:35.110 --> 33:37.350
What secrets could there be between us?

33:38.240 --> 33:39.840
But none of that matters now.

33:40.200 --> 33:42.920
Let's just get straight to the point.

33:43.070 --> 33:44.210
Mr. Screenwriter,

33:44.510 --> 33:46.740
how exactly did you time-travel here?

33:49.310 --> 33:51.200
It was all thanks to you two.

33:51.790 --> 33:53.160
I've been pulling my hair out every day

33:53.160 --> 33:55.550
just to squeeze out a tiny bit
of final draft,

33:55.550 --> 33:56.440
yet you two have been

33:56.440 --> 33:58.910
changing it all inexplicably the next day.

33:59.070 --> 34:00.030
At first, I didn't know

34:00.030 --> 34:01.290
and didn't believe it,

34:01.350 --> 34:02.510
so I kept writing,

34:02.510 --> 34:03.590
and you kept changing it.

34:03.590 --> 34:04.400
I write,

34:04.400 --> 34:05.000
you change.

34:05.000 --> 34:05.400
Write,

34:05.400 --> 34:06.000
change.

34:06.000 --> 34:07.400
Now the drama's about to start shooting.

34:07.400 --> 34:09.760
How am I supposed to explain this
to the client?

34:09.760 --> 34:10.590
Am I supposed to tell them that

34:10.590 --> 34:11.710
the male and female leads
aren't cooperating

34:11.710 --> 34:13.370
and keep changing the script?

34:13.550 --> 34:14.510
Or should I tell them

34:14.510 --> 34:17.370
the female lead has time-traveled
into the script?

34:21.590 --> 34:23.320
In the end, I ran out of options,

34:23.320 --> 34:24.480
so I wrote a story

34:24.510 --> 34:26.880
about the screenwriter
traveling into the script,

34:26.880 --> 34:28.670
just to see what would happen.

34:29.320 --> 34:31.070
Unexpectedly, I dozed off that night,

34:31.070 --> 34:32.730
and when I woke up the next day,

34:33.000 --> 34:35.199
I was actually here. Can you believe it?

34:36.920 --> 34:39.110
So you wrote yourself into this world.

34:39.400 --> 34:41.360
But I have to admit that
your time-traveling method

34:41.360 --> 34:43.489
is a bit more sophisticated than mine.

34:44.920 --> 34:46.300
So you came here

34:46.480 --> 34:48.139
to restore the original plot?

34:52.920 --> 34:53.760
I...

34:59.840 --> 35:01.440
I believe Your Highness

35:01.470 --> 35:04.070
wouldn't let that kind of thing
happen, right?

35:04.500 --> 35:05.230
Well...

35:05.250 --> 35:06.310
By the way, Xiaoyu,

35:06.440 --> 35:07.370
enough about me.

35:07.440 --> 35:09.370
Have you gotten used to being here?

35:09.760 --> 35:11.070
I'm doing fine here.

35:11.800 --> 35:13.920
There are carriages and houses here,

35:13.920 --> 35:15.050
and there's no smog.

35:15.190 --> 35:16.760
And I even managed

35:16.760 --> 35:18.760
to snag a boyfriend while I was at it.

35:29.000 --> 35:30.150
Really?

35:31.350 --> 35:33.590
Is this more delicious than
the Starbucks afternoon tea?

35:33.590 --> 35:34.400
Well,

35:34.510 --> 35:35.840
each has its own merits.

35:37.660 --> 35:39.920
Can that thing provide warmth
like modern underfloor heating?

35:39.920 --> 35:41.320
I won't freeze to death here anyway.

35:41.320 --> 35:42.110
It's fine.

35:44.280 --> 35:45.940
There's no water heater for bathing here,

35:45.940 --> 35:47.670
no automatic toilets in the bathroom,

35:47.670 --> 35:49.710
and you can't even scroll through
your phone before bed.

35:49.710 --> 35:50.920
What kind of life is this?

35:50.920 --> 35:52.920
It's like living as an ascetic monk.

35:56.800 --> 35:59.000
"Dream of Qingning" will start shooting
at the end of the month.

35:59.000 --> 36:01.990
It's definitely a top-tier production.

36:02.150 --> 36:03.080
I'm telling you,

36:03.110 --> 36:04.590
if you were in the modern world,

36:04.590 --> 36:07.450
you'd definitely be the next
hit-leading actress.

36:07.510 --> 36:09.800
Lord Qianyu, are you implying something?

36:09.800 --> 36:10.590
No, I'm not.

36:11.190 --> 36:12.280
How to live

36:12.670 --> 36:14.230
and where to settle down

36:14.670 --> 36:16.400
are Song Yimeng's own choices.

36:16.960 --> 36:18.620
If you have ulterior motives,

36:18.880 --> 36:20.410
I'll be the first to object.

36:22.280 --> 36:24.000
Which eye of yours saw

36:24.440 --> 36:26.100
that I have ulterior motives?

36:26.670 --> 36:27.730
Then let me ask you,

36:28.000 --> 36:29.600
what brought you here today?

36:29.670 --> 36:30.880
To visit a hometown folk.

36:30.880 --> 36:31.800
Visit a hometown folk,

36:31.800 --> 36:33.880
yet criticize their way of life like that?

36:33.880 --> 36:35.800
Can't I, as a modern person,
make a few complaints?

36:35.800 --> 36:37.550
I think you're just being sarcastic

36:37.550 --> 36:39.150
with malicious intentions!

36:39.320 --> 36:40.150
You're just over-interpreting

36:39.430 --> 36:42.040
[Achieve Great Ambitions]

36:40.150 --> 36:41.360
and reading into nothing!

36:41.360 --> 36:41.920
You...

36:42.110 --> 36:42.880
Alright, alright.

36:42.880 --> 36:43.920
Stop arguing.

36:44.840 --> 36:45.700
Nan Heng.

36:45.960 --> 36:47.190
I understand

36:47.400 --> 36:48.510
all your concerns.

36:48.880 --> 36:49.940
Mr. Screenwriter,

36:50.150 --> 36:52.400
I've figured out
what you're getting at too.

36:52.400 --> 36:53.000
Come on.

36:53.000 --> 36:54.170
Come out with me for a bit.

36:54.170 --> 36:59.520
[Achieve Great Ambitions]

37:08.630 --> 37:09.960
Let me have a sip of that herbal tea.

37:09.960 --> 37:12.290
Last night, His Lordship
made me bow to him

37:12.360 --> 37:13.630
for four hours,

37:13.630 --> 37:15.710
and insisted I address him
with genuine feeling in every word.

37:15.710 --> 37:16.760
This morning when I woke up,

37:16.760 --> 37:18.190
my throat was on fire.

37:18.710 --> 37:20.760
That's nothing compared to my situation.

37:20.760 --> 37:22.400
Yesterday, His Lordship made me
hold a horse stance

37:22.400 --> 37:23.860
for the entire afternoon,

37:24.030 --> 37:26.920
saying something about experiencing
the strength of the Qianyu Army.

37:26.920 --> 37:28.030
This morning when I got up,

37:28.030 --> 37:30.160
my legs were shaking uncontrollably.

37:31.440 --> 37:32.470
What are you doing?

37:32.470 --> 37:33.730
What are you all doing?

37:33.840 --> 37:35.900
Don't you have anything better to do?

37:36.710 --> 37:37.960
Now that we're not at war,

37:37.960 --> 37:39.960
you've even forgotten
how to train yourselves, huh?

37:39.960 --> 37:42.360
Go run ten laps
around the training ground!

37:42.480 --> 37:43.280
Let's go.

37:48.110 --> 37:48.920
General.

37:49.440 --> 37:50.700
I've failed in my duty.

37:51.150 --> 37:52.920
Our men like to make

37:52.920 --> 37:55.150
silly jokes during their free time.

37:55.550 --> 37:57.210
Please don't take it to heart.

38:00.960 --> 38:02.290
Do you know which of them

38:02.920 --> 38:04.670
witnessed my father's death in battle

38:04.670 --> 38:06.870
from the Pingrong City Tower back then?

38:09.760 --> 38:12.160
Why would you ask
such a question, General?

38:14.960 --> 38:16.220
There are some matters

38:16.400 --> 38:18.060
I've always had doubts about.

38:18.440 --> 38:19.230
Rong Hua,

38:20.280 --> 38:22.680
I want you
to investigate something for me.

38:30.510 --> 38:31.440
Let me ask you,

38:31.760 --> 38:33.710
did you come to
the Crown Prince's Residence

38:33.710 --> 38:35.320
to take me back with you?

38:35.550 --> 38:36.360
That's right.

38:36.510 --> 38:38.150
I wanted to talk to you alone,

38:38.360 --> 38:39.960
but I didn't expect Nan Heng to be here,

38:39.960 --> 38:41.960
so I couldn't speak plainly.

38:43.230 --> 38:44.190
What do you mean?

38:45.000 --> 38:45.940
Are you saying

38:46.320 --> 38:47.710
you know how to get back?

38:47.710 --> 38:48.480
Of course.

38:49.400 --> 38:50.440
Who am I?

38:50.630 --> 38:51.550
I'm the screenwriter.

38:51.550 --> 38:53.230
I set all the rules here.

38:53.440 --> 38:54.300
Let me tell you,

38:54.400 --> 38:56.320
the script world has four...

38:58.630 --> 38:59.880
Three rules.

39:00.510 --> 39:02.630
Besides the hero always saving the heroine
when she's in danger,

39:02.630 --> 39:04.320
and the iconic scenes must happen,

39:04.320 --> 39:05.550
there's one more rule:

39:05.550 --> 39:08.680
once we complete all the iconic scenes
until the finale,

39:08.710 --> 39:09.930
we can get back.

39:15.280 --> 39:16.070
I see.

39:16.840 --> 39:18.400
You want me to help you complete

39:18.400 --> 39:19.590
the city tower choice scene,

39:19.590 --> 39:20.360
and also go through

39:20.360 --> 39:21.760
the scenes where I become a human pig,

39:21.760 --> 39:22.440
right?

39:23.590 --> 39:24.680
Smart.

39:25.670 --> 39:27.030
But if you're afraid of pain,

39:27.030 --> 39:29.690
I can have Zhao prepare
some anesthetic for you.

39:31.360 --> 39:33.420
The doctor who saved Nan Heng's life.

39:34.240 --> 39:36.280
But if we follow the original plot,

39:36.280 --> 39:37.590
the entire Song family will be executed.

39:37.590 --> 39:38.520
Do you know that?

39:39.220 --> 39:40.640
What Song family or Li family?

39:40.640 --> 39:42.630
They're all just fictional characters.

39:42.630 --> 39:43.440
You...

39:44.800 --> 39:45.590
What?

39:50.880 --> 39:51.590
Nothing.

39:55.150 --> 39:56.550
So what if

39:57.150 --> 39:59.000
we don't follow the original plot?

39:59.000 --> 40:00.000
What will happen?

40:02.030 --> 40:04.760
Then we'll be trapped here forever.

40:04.790 --> 40:06.510
I won't become a top-tier screenwriter,

40:06.510 --> 40:07.960
and your dream of becoming an actress

40:07.960 --> 40:10.020
will shatter like broken glass, too.

40:12.960 --> 40:14.630
Alright, that's fine.

40:14.800 --> 40:16.880
As long as this world doesn't collapse.

40:16.880 --> 40:18.210
What do you mean "fine"?

40:23.400 --> 40:25.230
Do you really want to stay here

40:25.230 --> 40:27.360
and be the God of Death's beloved wife?

40:29.400 --> 40:30.460
Listen carefully,

40:30.760 --> 40:32.400
Nan Heng is not some God of Death,

40:32.400 --> 40:33.510
and I'm not that

40:33.510 --> 40:34.920
love-obsessed Song Yimeng
from your writing.

40:34.920 --> 40:36.440
I'm very happy with this world,

40:36.440 --> 40:37.630
and I won't go back with you.

40:37.630 --> 40:38.710
You've gone crazy!

40:40.630 --> 40:42.000
He's put a spell on you.

40:42.000 --> 40:44.530
Don't forget he's going to kill you
in the end.

40:45.550 --> 40:46.680
I know.

40:47.190 --> 40:48.450
At first,

40:48.590 --> 40:50.030
he did want to kill me,

40:50.320 --> 40:52.150
but everything is different now.

40:52.150 --> 40:53.710
The keyboard sounds have disappeared,

40:53.710 --> 40:56.070
and he's already broken free from
his original character design.

40:56.070 --> 40:56.960
How could he hurt me

40:56.960 --> 40:58.290
or harm the Song family?

40:58.510 --> 41:00.320
This is just a fictional world.

41:00.320 --> 41:01.360
The sky is fake,

41:01.360 --> 41:02.070
the ground is fake,

41:02.070 --> 41:03.510
everything here is completely fake,

41:03.510 --> 41:04.880
as well as our bodies.

41:04.880 --> 41:05.880
Wake up, will you?

41:08.480 --> 41:09.000
Fine.

41:11.510 --> 41:12.590
What are you doing?

41:13.400 --> 41:14.840
Does it hurt, Mr. Screenwriter?

41:14.840 --> 41:15.510
Of course it does!

41:15.510 --> 41:16.710
Good, it should hurt.

41:17.710 --> 41:18.590
Let me tell you,

41:18.760 --> 41:20.920
from the moment you entered this world,

41:20.920 --> 41:22.440
this entire world became real.

41:22.440 --> 41:23.150
The sky is real,

41:23.150 --> 41:23.840
the ground is real,

41:23.840 --> 41:24.840
everything is real,

41:24.840 --> 41:26.710
as well as our bodies.

41:26.710 --> 41:27.440
Understand?

41:27.710 --> 41:28.630
Why are you copying what I said?

41:28.630 --> 41:29.400
Be quiet.

41:29.760 --> 41:31.090
I haven't finished yet.

41:32.880 --> 41:33.960
You're right.

41:34.190 --> 41:35.440
Outside the script,

41:35.550 --> 41:36.960
you are indeed the creator
who makes the rules

41:36.960 --> 41:38.590
and commands the world.

41:38.760 --> 41:40.280
But in this world,

41:40.510 --> 41:41.840
you're just a rookie.

41:42.150 --> 41:43.230
Instead of trying to convince me,

41:43.230 --> 41:45.710
why not let me, your senior,

41:45.920 --> 41:47.840
show you what this real world is like,

41:47.840 --> 41:48.900
Mr. Screenwriter?

41:52.530 --> 41:54.020
The real world?

41:55.190 --> 42:02.230
[Achieve Great Ambitions]

42:00.670 --> 42:01.530
Your Highness,

42:01.670 --> 42:02.800
something terrible has happened!

42:02.800 --> 42:03.710
Her Highness and Lord Qianyu

42:03.710 --> 42:05.550
were whispering to each other
for quite a while,

42:05.550 --> 42:07.840
and she even said she wants to take him
to Waning River Crescent for a visit.

42:07.840 --> 42:09.300
To Waning River Crescent?

42:09.670 --> 42:10.710
The Crown Princess said that?

42:10.710 --> 42:11.440
Yes.

42:11.920 --> 42:13.190
And she asked me to tell Your Highness

42:13.190 --> 42:14.440
not to worry at all.

42:14.510 --> 42:15.840
How can you not worry?

42:16.030 --> 42:18.320
Back then, the engagement between
Her Highness and Chu Guihong

42:18.320 --> 42:20.150
was arranged by Lord Qianyu himself.

42:20.150 --> 42:22.110
What if he's now trying
to steal Her Highness away

42:22.110 --> 42:23.960
to rekindle her relationship
with Chu Guihong?

42:23.960 --> 42:25.220
What should we do then?

42:27.000 --> 42:27.860
Your Highness?

42:27.960 --> 42:28.960
Are you alright, Your Highness?

42:28.960 --> 42:29.710
Are you okay?

42:30.150 --> 42:30.810
Please sit.

42:34.150 --> 42:35.010
Your Highness,

42:35.630 --> 42:36.960
ever since you got married,

42:36.960 --> 42:38.230
your health has weakened.

42:38.230 --> 42:39.960
You should moderate yourself.

42:42.280 --> 42:43.760
Your Highness, why are you
coughing up blood?

42:43.760 --> 42:44.710
I'll go fetch the imperial physician!

42:44.710 --> 42:45.440
Wait!

42:47.670 --> 42:48.600
Keep this quiet.

42:49.000 --> 42:50.130
Don't blab about it.

42:50.480 --> 42:51.150
Yes, Your Highness.
